{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lone samurai, consumed by grief and vengeance, walks the path of blood.</strong> His wife\u2014murdered. His daughter\u2014taken. With nothing left but his blade and a burning will to strike down injustice, he races through the shadows of feudal Japan, hunting those who shattered his world. Each duel is a test of speed, precision, and nerve. There are no second chances. Only the clash of steel and the silence that follows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Samurai Stratagem\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced, twitch-reflex action game where every input is a strike, every mistake a wound. Face five deadly samurai in one-on-one battles, each more brutal than the last. React to directional prompts, dodge feints, master holds and double taps, and unleash flawless combos to carve your revenge into the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning-Fast Combat</strong> \u2013 Input-based duels that demand razor-sharp reflexes and total focus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Pixel Art Style</strong> \u2013 Clean visuals with cinematic flair, inspired by classic samurai showdowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Encounters</strong> \u2013 One mistake can cost everything. Blood sprays, sparks fly, and tension builds with every clash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score-Based Arcade Mode</strong> \u2013 Chase perfection, climb the leaderboard, and prove your mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, Replayable Campaign</strong> \u2013 Five intense battles. One path to vengeance. How fast can you finish it?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No rhythm. No mercy. Just you, your blade, and the speed of your mind.</strong> Are you ready to embrace the way of the sword?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ronin Slayer","path":"htt